  1.  User: An entity that will access the aws console/cli and perform operation on it.role
  2.  Policies: A set of permissions that are clubbed together for creating a access document.
  3.  Role: An entity that provide access to other virtual entity lambda, EC2, aws service 
  4.  Group: A group has a number of policy assign to it. and all the user in this group will have those policy assigned to them automatucally.
   
